  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.3.0 makes the TypeScript path and the crap scope explicit.\nREADME: Vitest (accurate source branches) and c8 (zero-config wrapper around node --test) produce Cobertura for check; Jest still works.\ncrap is for .NET: a report in which no method has complexity (Istanbul: Vitest, c8, Jest; coverage.py) now gets a NODATA reason that says so instead of pointing at dotnet msbuild.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.3.0.md",
